            <th class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 text-left font-bold">Critère</th>
            <th class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 text-center font-bold">DVH réduit</th>
            <th class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 text-center font-bold">DVH classique</th>
            <th class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 text-center font-bold">DVH élargi</th>
